&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;1- You make a &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;YouTube review video of application&lt;/span&gt; while you are in trail period,showing atleast 5 features of applications and installation instructions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;2- You need to include &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;your account Id in the video description&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;3- You fill the form below with your video ID, &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;after review of your video your account gets activated&lt;/span&gt; following a confirmation email titled &amp;quot;PlayList account activation&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
